---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Easy Todo List"
  description="Read the terms and conditions for using Easy Todo List. Understand your responsibilities, our disclaimers, and the rules for using our service."
  canonicalUrl="https://easytodolist.com/terms"
>
  <div class="bg-canvas-soft py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-10">
        <p class="text-caption text-mute uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink font-semibold mb-4">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Last updated: July 21, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-body space-y-4">
        <p>
          Welcome to Easy Todo List. By using our website and services, you agree to these terms and conditions. Please read them carefully before using our service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using Easy Todo List, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you may not use our service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Description of Service</h2>
        <p>
          Easy Todo List provides a free, browser-based task management tool. Our service allows users to create, organize, categorize, and share todo lists. All features are provided free of charge.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>When using our service, you agree to:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4" style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1rem;">
          <li>Use the service only for lawful purposes</li>
          <li>Not attempt to gain unauthorized access to any systems</li>
          <li>Not interfere with the proper operation of the website</li>
          <li>Not use automated tools to excessively burden our servers</li>
          <li>Not share content that is illegal, harmful, or offensive</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Data Ownership and Storage</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Your Data:</strong> You retain full ownership of any data you input into Easy Todo List. All task data is stored locally in your browser's localStorage and is not transmitted to our servers.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>No Backup Service:</strong> We do not provide data backup services. You are responsible for backing up any important data through your own means (e.g., screenshot, copy/paste).
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Data Loss:</strong> Clearing your browser data, using private/incognito mode, or switching browsers will result in loss of stored data unless you have created a backup or shared list.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Sharing and Shared Links</h2>
        <p>
          When you use the share feature:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4" style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1rem;">
          <li>The list data is encoded directly into the share URL</li>
          <li>We do not store shared data on our servers</li>
          <li>Anyone with the link can view the shared list</li>
          <li>You should only share links with trusted individuals</li>
          <li>Shared links may be stored in browser history and server logs</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Service Availability</h2>
        <p>
          We strive to keep Easy Todo List available at all times. However, we do not guarantee uninterrupted access. The service may be temporarily unavailable due to:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4" style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1rem;">
          <li>Scheduled or emergency maintenance</li>
          <li>Technical issues beyond our control</li>
          <li>Internet connectivity problems</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We are not liable for any downtime or data loss resulting from service interruptions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          Easy Todo List is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4" style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1rem;">
          <li>Implied warranties of merchantability</li>
          <li>Fitness for a particular purpose</li>
          <li>Non-infringement</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not warrant that the service will be error-free, secure, or completely reliable.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Easy Todo List and its operators shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including but not limited to loss of profits, data, or other intangible losses resulting from:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4" style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1rem;">
          <li>Your use of or inability to use the service</li>
          <li>Any unauthorized access to your data</li>
          <li>Any interruptions or cessation of the service</li>
          <li>Any bugs, viruses, or similar issues</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          The Easy Todo List name, logo, design, and all related content are our intellectual property. You may not copy, modify, or distribute these elements without our written permission.
        </p>
        <p>
          The service is for your personal or internal business use. You may not resell, redistribute, or commercially exploit the service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not owned or controlled by us. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to this page. Your continued use of the service after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be resolved through appropriate legal channels.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms & Conditions, please <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:border-b border-link">contact us</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-hairline text-center">
        <p class="text-body mb-4">Ready to get organized?</p>
        <a
          href="/app"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-10 px-6 text-button-md font-[500] text-on-primary bg-primary rounded-full hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          Create a List →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>